{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026gY48NdG32r1792908064.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港乳癌基金會在山頂舉行慈善步行籌款活動。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.RUN-1130_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20260aTeuq5OUh1792908137.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>行政長官夫人李林麗嬋、民政及青年事務局局長麥美娟等出席啟動禮，近2,000名參加者，由山頂道花園步行至凌霄閣，完成約3.5公里路程，籌得的款項將用作支持乳癌檢查及教育等。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.RUN-1130_005.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026CPWluwRgtv1792908315.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>麥美娟致辭時強調，政府重視乳癌防控及患者支援工作，又提到局方本月會推出家庭教育推廣計劃，教育家庭價值。</p><p></p><p>民政及青年事務局局長麥美娟說：「在五年規劃中，有專設婦女發展的內容，明確以賦能婦女發展潛力為政府目標，特區政府會致力締造有利婦女發展的環境、保障婦女權益、促進婦女身心健康。讓處於不同崗位、社會位置及人生階段的婦女都能實現多元發展。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T08:23:47.675975+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":276,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T05:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T05:58:03.732320+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T08:20:13.193038+00:00","content_hash":"5e45d58e8113dbd05df824c4ae0b4d3dd19b4f4ea504779ff313fa1b7cb68d5f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-25T08:23:47.675975+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}